# Nothing about the child goes into version control. (DECISIONS.md D5.)
# The app writes only to on-device IndexedDB, so the risk here is a backup file
# saved into the project folder by accident — which is a full record of a named
# four-year-old, and would be published the moment the repo is.
early-years-*.json
*.backup.json
/backups/

# The archived curriculum PDF is a public government regulation and is meant to
# be committed — it is the project's ground truth. Do not add it here.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
